# Trivy vulnerability IDs to waive, one per line, each with a reason above it.
# `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` is read by Trivy itself: past that date the waiver stops
# applying and the scan fails again, so nothing stays ignored by accident.
#
# Passed to the reusable Docker build with `trivyignores: <path to this file>`.
#
# Base image tzdata, upstream fix not in the base yet.
# CVE-2026-0000 exp:2026-12-31
